Design and build a premium, modern, production-ready ERP frontend for a traditional Korai Mat Manufacturing Industry.

The ERP should automate the complete business workflow from raw-material purchase to finished Korai Mat sales, including inventory, production, employee work tracking, salary calculation, bonus calculation, expenses, sales, profit/loss, and reports.

The UI must feel like a professional manufacturing ERP used by a real industrial company — NOT like a generic admin dashboard.

TECH STACK:
- React.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui or equivalent premium UI components
- Recharts for charts
- Framer Motion for subtle animations
- Responsive design
- Desktop-first but fully responsive for tablet and mobile
- Component-based architecture
- Clean reusable components

VISUAL STYLE:
- Premium industrial ERP
- Clean, modern, professional
- White/light background with deep navy/charcoal accents
- Korai/natural-material inspired subtle green and earthy accent colors
- Glassmorphism only where appropriate
- Rounded cards
- Soft shadows
- Clear typography
- Excellent spacing
- Professional tables
- Status badges
- Smooth hover animations
- Minimal unnecessary decoration
- Strong information hierarchy
- Use icons consistently
- Avoid excessive gradients
- Avoid overly colorful dashboard
- Make it look suitable for a real factory/company environment

